coach "By the Numbers"
about "Calls whatever the numbers say makes the yards needed - one of the plays not clearly worse than the best - and on defense whatever stops it most often."

offense:
  when game ending and leading by over 0 and clock under 100 -> kneel
  when to go under 3 -> call the best run
  when third down or fourth down -> call the best play
  when trailing by over 7 and half ending -> call the best pass
  otherwise -> call the best play

defense:
  otherwise -> call the best defense

lineup:
  QB "Pocket Passer"
  RB "Patient Runner"
  WR "Route Runner"
  TE "Receiving TE"
  OL "Pass Protector"
  DL "Bull Rusher"
  LB "Coverage LB"
  CB "Shutdown Corner"
  S "Center Fielder"
